<title>ITALY: ENI sees improved 1997 net profit.</title>
<headline>ENI sees improved 1997 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian energy giant ENI said it expected 1997 net profit to show a further improvement on 1996.</p>
<p>ENI said in the prospectus for its third tranche sale in June that 1997 pre-tax profit, based on the current trend, should be above the 8.787 trillion lire of 1996 while net profit would show a &quot;further improvement.&quot; -- Rome newsroom +396 6782501</p>
</text>
